",{"children":"Once an export is running, different recipients need different ways to learn its state. A browser, another server, and a scheduled maintenance task do not share the same delivery contract. The queue remains the internal work path; these are ways to trigger or report work."}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-0",{"id":"choose-by-recipient-and-direction","children":"Choose by recipient and direction"}],"\n","$L19","\n","$L1a","\n","$L1b","\n","$L1c","\n","$L1d","\n","$L1e","\n","$L1f","\n","$L20","\n","$L21","\n","$L22","\n","$L23","\n","$L24","\n","$L25","\n","$L26","\n","$L27","\n","$L28","\n","$L29","\n","$L2a"],false]}]]}],"$L2b"]}]}]
